//! Painting what `paint_css` reads: background and mask image layers (linear, radial and conic
//! gradients with any number of stops, sized, positioned and repeated), `text-shadow`, and the isolated layers for
//! `filter`, `mix-blend-mode`, `clip-path` and `mask`. A run of filter functions that the scene
//! applies in its own order (blur, color matrix, drop shadow) shares one layer; others nest.
